          ],
          "content": "**Obtuse Angle:** Angles that are greater than the right angle and less than the straight angle, i.e., greater than $9 0 ^ { \\circ }$ and less than $1 8 0 ^ { \\circ }$ , are called **obtuse** angles."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
