        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.344,
            0.833,
            0.39
          ],
          "content": "Have we covered all the possible measures that an angle can take? Here is another type of angle."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.396,
            0.834,
            0.461
          ],
          "content": "**Reflex angle:** Angles that are greater than the straight angle and less than the whole angle, i.e., greater than $1 8 0 ^ { \\circ }$ and less than $3 6 0 ^ { \\circ } ]$ , are called **reflex** angles."
        },
        {
